      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "DEMO: Describe one image. Empty Image provides a synthetic blue square; Local Vision reads its pixels and prompt, then sends a description to the viewer. This is image analysis, not image generation or palette selection.\n\n1. Download Qwen3-VL 2B with ↓ on local vision if missing (about 3.3 GB).\n2. Press top Run. The image source is a solid blue fixture; its description appears on the right.\n3. Replace Empty Image with your own Load Image and connect IMAGE to local vision.image.\nVision reads one queued image. No camera or upload is started.\n\nNodes in this demo:\nEmptyImage · 1 · synthetic blue image\nꘅ Local Vision · 2 · describe this image\nꘅ Text / JSON Viewer · Read the result\nPreviewImage · Image being analyzed"
      ]
    },
